01:00:00,000 --> 01:00:06,000
Scoop is a 2006 romantic crime comedy film written and directed by Woody Allen and
starring Hugh Jackman, Scarlett Johansson, Ian McShane and Allen himself.

11
01:06:00,000 --> 01:06:06,000
It was released in the United States by Focus Features on July 28, 2006.

12
01:12:00,000 --> 01:12:06,000
The film follows an American journalist and a magician being guided by the spirit of a
reporter to investigate a British aristocrat who might be a serial killer.

13
01:18:00,000 --> 01:18:06,000
Scoop received mixed reviews from critics regarding its humor, but was a
box-office success, grossing $39 million against a $4 million budget.

14
01:24:00,000 --> 01:24:06,000
The film explores themes of daughter, newspaper,
journalist, prostitute, drowning.

15
